# Apps that always go around iVPN (directly), however they are started.
# One program name per line; case doesn't matter. Saved changes apply within
# about a second -- no rebuild. Removing a name puts that app back on the VPN.
#
# The name is the program's process name, as shown by e.g.
#   ps -eo comm | sort -u
# (Nix's ".foo-wrapped" names are matched as just "foo".)
#
chrome
steam
max         # MAX messenger (Flatpak ru.max.MAX); max.ru doesn't answer via the VPN exit
yandex-music  # Yandex Music (nixpkgs); Electron -- the launcher is caught, electron inherits
qbittorrent   # torrents: around both iVPN and v2rayN (v2rayN keeps its own list)
